sequenceDiagram
    participant FS as Local filesystem
    participant C as Go client
    participant DB as Local SQLite
    participant W as Cloudflare Worker
    participant DO as Durable Object SQLite
    participant R2 as Cloudflare R2

    Note over FS,C: Local change or startup reconcile
    FS->>C: fsnotify event or reconcile output
    C->>DB: RecordChange: local_files + pending_operations
    C->>C: Build manifest and rehash pending files
    C->>W: POST /v2/sync/plan
    W->>DO: Read file metadata and tombstones
    DO-->>W: Current metadata
    W-->>C: Upload, download, delete, or conflict actions

    alt Upload
        C->>W: PUT /v2/files/{sha256}
        W->>R2: Store content-addressed bytes
        C->>W: POST /v2/sync/commit
        W->>DO: Update active metadata
        W-->>C: Accepted commit
    else Download
        C->>W: GET /v2/files/{sha256}
        W->>R2: Read content-addressed bytes
        R2-->>W: File bytes
        W-->>C: File bytes
        C->>FS: Atomic temp-file write and rename
        C->>DB: Mark file synced
    else Delete
        C->>W: POST /v2/sync/commit (delete)
        W->>DO: Store tombstone
        W-->>C: Accepted commit
        C->>DB: Untrack local file
    end

    W-->>C: SSE change notification
    C->>C: Trigger another sync pass
